# Brand name: NewYou AI

The brand is **NewYou AI**. The accepted short form is **NewYou**. Never write the
name as "New You" with a space between "New" and "You".

## Normalization rules

- `New You` (no AI)            -> `NewYou`
- `New You AI`                 -> `NewYou AI`
- `NewYouAI` (no space + AI)   -> `NewYou AI`

Do not add "AI" where it was not already present. When shortening, use `NewYou`
(one word), never `New You`.

## Examples

```tsx
// BAD
<Text>Discover a New You</Text>
title: "New You AI Admin"
"Welcome to NewYouAI"

// GOOD
<Text>Discover a NewYou</Text>
title: "NewYou AI Admin"
"Welcome to NewYou AI"
```

## Do not touch (these are technical identifiers, not the display name)

- Package scope `@newyouai/*`, bundle/package id `app.newyouai.mobile`, scheme `newyouai://`
- Domains/URLs (`newyouai.app`, `app.newyouai.app`, `support@newyouai.app`), social handles
- Asset filenames (`newyou-mark.png`, `newyou-logo.png`), test emails `@newyouai.test`
